Q10 : Write a program to implement Propositional Logic and evaluate logical expressions using 
operators such as AND, OR, and IMPLIES

Program

# Program to implement Propositional Logic
# using AND, OR and IMPLIES
P = True
Q = False
# AND
AND_result = P and Q
# OR
OR_result = P or Q
# IMPLIES: P -> Q = NOT P OR Q
IMPLIES_result = (not P) or Q
print("P =", P)
print("Q =", Q)
print("\nLogical Operations:")
print("P AND Q =", AND_result)
print("P OR Q =", OR_result)
print("P IMPLIES Q =", IMPLIES_result)

Output
P = True
Q = False
Logical Operations:
P AND Q = False
P OR Q = True
P IMPLIES Q = False

